<details class="regional-method"><summary data-en="Sources & data coverage" data-zh="资料来源与覆盖范围" >Sources & data coverage</summary><p data-en="Wayne, Oakland and Macomb counties. Fixed colors compare density; source boundaries and census categories can change. County totals cannot locate neighborhoods." data-zh="范围为 Wayne、Oakland、Macomb 三县。跨年固定色阶；资料边界与统计分类可能变化。县总数无法定位街区。" >Wayne, Oakland and Macomb counties. Fixed colors compare density; source boundaries and census categories can change. County totals cannot locate neighborhoods.</p><p data-en="Census: 1900, 1910, 1980, 1990, 2000, 2010. ACS: 2010–2014, 2015–2019, 2020–2024. Gaps use the latest earlier dataset, with its date shown. Select the ground for counts, definitions and uncertainty." data-zh="普查：1900、1910、1980、1990、2000、2010；ACS：2010–2014、2015–2019、2020–2024。资料空档沿用最近的既有数据，并标明资料年份。点击地面查看人数、口径与误差。" >Census: 1900, 1910, 1980, 1990, 2000, 2010. ACS: 2010–2014, 2015–2019, 2020–2024. Gaps use the latest earlier dataset, with its date shown. Select the ground for counts, definitions and uncertainty.</p><p data-en="Activity is an 18-place pilot directory, not a visitor count or complete business register. One weight per site; fixed 1 km smoothing and 3 km cutoff. Website snapshots do not establish opening dates." data-zh="活动层为 18 处地点的试点名录，不是人流量或完整商业统计。每处地点权重为 1；固定 1 km 平滑、3 km 截断。网站快照不能证明开业日期。" >Activity is an 18-place pilot directory, not a visitor count or complete business register. One weight per site; fixed 1 km smoothing and 3 km cutoff. Website snapshots do not establish opening dates.</p><p data-en="Filled: population available, including carried data. Dot: documented activity." data-zh="填色：有人口资料，包括沿用数据；圆点：有活动记录。" >Filled: population available, including carried data. Dot: documented activity.</p><div id="regional-coverage" class="regional-coverage"></div><label><input id="regional-references" type="checkbox"><span data-en="Show separate historical city totals (Asian + Pacific Islander)" data-zh="显示独立历史城市总数（亚裔及太平洋岛民）" >Show separate historical city totals (Asian + Pacific Islander)</span></label><p><a href="https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/data/summary-file.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">U.S. Census Bureau</a> · <a href="https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/66fbeec68dba4b5f98f0ff2560586a4d" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-en="Detroit StoryMap" data-zh="底特律 StoryMap" >Detroit StoryMap</span></a></p></details>
</div>
