<div id="atlas-controls74" class="atlas-controls74"><div id="layer-bar80"><strong id="layerbar-title80" data-no-translate data-nav80-en="Map layers" data-nav80-zh="地图图层">Map layers</strong><div class="source-layer-control" role="group" aria-label="Map layers"><label><input id="show-rendering" type="checkbox" disabled> Rendering effects</label><label><input id="show-regional" type="checkbox"> Regional population & activity</label><label><input id="show-basemap" type="checkbox"> Present-day map</label><label><input id="show-historical-map" type="checkbox"> Historical map</label><label><input id="show-roads" type="checkbox" checked> Historical roads</label><label><input id="show-rail" type="checkbox" checked> Railways</label><label title="Controls map labels; text printed in map images remains."><input id="show-road-labels" type="checkbox"> Road names</label><label><input id="show-building-labels" type="checkbox" checked> Building tags</label><label><input id="show-chinatown-labels" type="checkbox" checked> Chinatown tags</label></div><button id="solar-toggle80" type="button" disabled aria-controls="solar-options80" aria-expanded="false" data-no-translate data-nav80-en="Sun" data-nav80-zh="日照">Sun</button><button id="key-toggle80" type="button" aria-controls="map-options" aria-expanded="false" data-no-translate data-nav80-en="Key" data-nav80-zh="图例">Key</button></div><div id="solar-options80" hidden data-no-translate><div class="solar-inputs80"><strong data-nav80-en="Reference sunlight" data-nav80-zh="参考日照">Reference sunlight</strong><label><span data-nav80-en="Month" data-nav80-zh="月">Month</span><input id="solar-month80" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="6"></label><label><span data-nav80-en="Day" data-nav80-zh="日">Day</span><input id="solar-day80" type="number" min="1" max="31" value="21"></label><label><span data-nav80-en="Detroit time" data-nav80-zh="底特律时间">Detroit time</span><input id="solar-time80" type="time" value="14:00" step="60"></label></div><p id="solar-state80"></p><p><span data-nav80-en="Year follows the timeline. Daylight is calculated for the camera location, with Detroit time-zone history. This is a reference setting, not evidence of historical weather." data-nav80-zh="年份随时间线变化。日照按镜头所在地和底特律历史时区计算。这是参考光照设置，不代表历史天气。">Year follows the timeline. Daylight is calculated for the camera location, with Detroit time-zone history. This is a reference setting, not evidence of historical weather.</span> <a href="https://gml.noaa.gov/grad/solcalc/calcdetails.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NOAA / Meeus</a></p></div><details id="map-options"><summary id="map-options-title" data-no-translate>Map layers &amp; key</summary><p id="building-tag-rule" data-no-translate>Building names appear when zoomed in.</p><p class="coastal-key78" data-no-translate><span id="coastal-note78"></span> <a href="https://www.internationalboundarycommission.org/en/maps-coordinates/coordinates.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IBC</a><a href="https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/inport/item/60812" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NOAA</a><a href="https://ws.lioservices.lrc.gov.on.ca/arcgis2/rest/services/LIO_OPEN_DATA/LIO_Open01/MapServer/25" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ontario Hydro Network</a></p>
